{"title":"Career Roadmap · VFX Artist","role":"VFX Artist","summary":"A VFX Artist creates, integrates, and enhances visual elements that cannot be captured practically or need significant digital manipulation. The role can involve compositing, rotoscoping, tracking, keying, CG integration, matte painting, simulations, environments, effects and cleanup across films, OTT productions, advertising, games and immersive media.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Motion / Animation / VFX Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A VFX Artist creates, integrates, and enhances visual elements that cannot be captured practically or need significant digital manipulation. The role can involve compositing, rotoscoping, tracking, keying, CG integration, matte painting, simulations, environments, effects and cleanup across films, OTT productions, advertising, games and immersive media."},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Motion/Animation/VFX Design","VFX Internship","Roto/Prep/Junior VFX Artist","VFX Artist","Senior VFX Artist","Lead","CG/VFX Supervisor","VFX Supervisor / Creative Director"],"label":"Typical route"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Years","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Design, animation and compositing fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Exploration"},{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Roto, tracking, keying and VFX workflows"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"Advanced compositing/CG/effects"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"2029–2030"},{"text":"VFX Intern / Junior Artist"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Production VFX"}],[{"text":"Professional"},{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Complex shots and sequences"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"2037–2040"},{"text":"Senior/Lead Artist"}],[{"text":"Strategic"},{"text":"20